# The two road layers: 6,3 MB of geometry derived from the OSM extract, drawn as map context
# and read by nothing else. Moved to release data-v1 so the tracked tree stays under the gate
# in scripts/check_repo_size.py, which names these two files as the candidate. Rebuild with
# the pipeline's export, or fetch with scripts/fetch_release_data.py.
web/public/data/roads.geojson
web/public/data/roads-county.geojson
